#. module: nme_purchase
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_nme_purchase
msgid ""
"============================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Purchase\n"
"============================\n"
"\n"
"Purchase flow of Nusantara Mini ERP: request for quotation, purchase order\n"
"with tiered approval and receipt of the goods.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Features\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Requests for quotation sent by email with the PDF attached (sending marks\n"
"  the RFQ as sent), vendor reference and expected arrival date.\n"
"* **Tiered approval**: an order whose total (taxes included) reaches the\n"
"  company approval amount, confirmed by a purchase user, goes to\n"
"  *To Approve* and every purchase manager of the company gets a\n"
"  \"Purchase Approval\" activity. Managers approve or reject it; orders they\n"
"  confirm themselves skip the approval.\n"
"* Confirmed orders create the receipt of the goods. The received quantity\n"
"  and receipt status come from the stock ledger (returns to the vendor\n"
"  included), and receiving updates the average cost with the **net** price\n"
"  of the line (after discount, without taxes).\n"
"* Locked lines once waiting for approval or confirmed; cancellation with a\n"
"  reason, refused while goods are received and not returned.\n"
"* Kanban by status, calendar of expected arrivals, pivot and graph views,\n"
"  vendor smart button and a printable RFQ / purchase order.\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"*Nusantara ERP > Configuration > Settings > Purchase Approval*: approval\n"
"amount per company (default Rp 50.000.000, 0 disables the approval).\n"
"\n"
"Security\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* *Purchase / User*: every purchase order of their companies, and the\n"
"  receipts (incoming transfers).\n"
"* *Purchase / Manager*: approves or rejects orders above the threshold.\n"
"* Inventory users can read purchase orders to receive the goods.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Author\n"
"------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"License\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"
msgstr ""
"=============================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Pembelian\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Alur pembelian Nusantara Mini ERP: permintaan penawaran harga, pesanan\n"
"pembelian dengan persetujuan berjenjang dan penerimaan barang.\n"
"\n"
"**Daftar isi**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Fitur\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"* Permintaan penawaran harga dikirim melalui email dengan PDF terlampir\n"
"  (pengiriman menandai RFQ sebagai terkirim), referensi pemasok dan perkiraan\n"
"  tanggal kedatangan.\n"
"* **Persetujuan berjenjang**: pesanan yang totalnya (termasuk pajak) mencapai\n"
"  batas nilai persetujuan perusahaan dan dikonfirmasi oleh pengguna pembelian\n"
"  masuk ke status *Menunggu Persetujuan*, dan setiap manajer pembelian di\n"
"  perusahaan mendapat aktivitas \"Persetujuan Pembelian\". Manajer menyetujui\n"
"  atau menolaknya; pesanan yang mereka konfirmasi sendiri tidak memerlukan\n"
"  persetujuan.\n"
"* Pesanan yang dikonfirmasi membuat penerimaan barang. Jumlah diterima dan\n"
"  status penerimaan berasal dari buku besar stok (termasuk retur ke pemasok),\n"
"  dan penerimaan memperbarui biaya rata-rata dengan harga **bersih** baris\n"
"  (setelah diskon, tanpa pajak).\n"
"* Baris dikunci setelah menunggu persetujuan atau dikonfirmasi; pembatalan\n"
"  wajib disertai alasan, dan ditolak selama barang sudah diterima dan belum\n"
"  diretur.\n"
"* Kanban per status, kalender perkiraan kedatangan, tampilan pivot dan grafik,\n"
"  tombol cerdas pada pemasok serta RFQ / pesanan pembelian yang dapat dicetak.\n"
"\n"
"Konfigurasi\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"*Nusantara ERP > Konfigurasi > Pengaturan > Persetujuan Pembelian*: batas\n"
"nilai persetujuan per perusahaan (default Rp 50.000.000, 0 menonaktifkan\n"
"persetujuan).\n"
"\n"
"Keamanan\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* *Pembelian / Pengguna*: semua pesanan pembelian di perusahaannya, serta\n"
"  penerimaan barang (transfer masuk).\n"
"* *Pembelian / Manajer*: menyetujui atau menolak pesanan di atas batas.\n"
"* Pengguna persediaan dapat membaca pesanan pembelian untuk menerima barang.\n"
"\n"
"Kontributor\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Penulis\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"Lisensi\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"

